-  demux_din(63 downto 48)  <= din(15 downto  0);
-  demux_din(47 downto 32)  <= din(31 downto 16);
-  demux_din(31 downto 16)  <= din(47 downto 32);
-  demux_din(15 downto  0)  <= din(63 downto 48);
-
-
-  -- xpm_fifo_async: Asynchronous FIFO
